      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There's a cool world called The Timezone which spawns players into their timezone. It was really cool concept and during its early days I found people with close timezone with me even in the same region. Sadly, that world quickly went silent and the concept did not popularize. It would be cool to get such functionality official!",
