  "created": "2021-06-17T03:53:32.904Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the new regions update, it is harder to interact with users outside of our region. We NEED to be able to filter regions while searching for active worlds. VRChat is used by people learning languages and cultures, as well as wanting to speak in languages they are already fluent in. This is necessary now that we have multiple regions.",
